{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2023-02-27 11:00:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT SIGNS MEMORANDUM OF UNDERSTANDING WITH ANALOG DEVICES TO ADVANCE 6G TECHNOLOGY DESIGN AND DEVELOPMENT', 'text': 'SANTA ROSA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $KEYS #5G--KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: KEYS), A LEADING TECHNOLOGY COMPANY THAT DELIVERS ADVANCED DESIGN AND VALIDATION SOLUTIONS TO HELP ACCELERATE INNOVATION TO CONNECT AND SECURE THE WORLD, HAS ANNOUNCED IT HAS SIGNED A MEMORANDUM OF UNDERSTANDING (MOU) WITH ANALOG DEVICES, INC. (ADI), A GLOBAL SEMICONDUCTOR LEADER THAT BRIDGES THE PHYSICAL AND DIGITAL WORLDS TO ENABLE BREAKTHROUGHS AT THE INTELLIGENT EDGE, TO ADVANCE 6G TECHNOLOGY DESIGN AND DEVELOPMENT.'}